        <tr>
            <td>Dynamic Type Variable</td>
            <td>
                no dynamic keyword in java <br> 
            </td>
            <td>
                dynamic keyword is available in C# for dynamic type inference <br>
                dynamic i = 10; // i is inferred as object <br>
            </td>
            <td>
                no dynamic keyword in python <br>
                python is dynamically typed, so type inference is implicit <br>
                i = 10 # i is inferred as int <br>
                s = "Hello" # s is inferred as str <br>
            </td>
        </tr>
